<title>MEXICO: Coca-Cola FEMSA Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola FEMSA Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Oper Income	198.09 million		84.25 million</p>
<p>	Net		  126.15 million		84.41 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 2.035  bln		1.856 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   19.73  million   gain     30.16 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Coca-Cola Femsa, S.A. de C.V.</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
